 The original response remains available. Evidence maps, multiple suggestions,
 required acknowledgements and executable suggestions retain their normal
 type checks.
+
+## Coupled-status ownership
+
+The native coupled-run manifest and durable work ledgers remain the source of truth for
+`spiral coupled-status --run-dir PATH`. The command owns no new persisted state: it
+validates and summarizes `iterations.json` plus each iteration's
+`state/tui-work.json` without changing either file. Wire usage is the count of durable
+ledger requests; task usage is the subset charged to `task`, with the native omitted-
+charge default preserved. Missing interrupted usage is represented as unknown (`null`)
+rather than zero. Recorded completion is an observation of the manifest, not an
+independent verification or promotion authorization.
